const categoryDetails={
 '/stitching/':{eyebrow:'TAILORING SERVICES',title:'Ladies suit stitching in Lahore',startingPrice:1000,intro:'Custom shalwar kameez and ladies suits planned around your preferred fit, neckline, sleeves, shirt length and trouser style.',image:IMAGES.stitching,faq:[['What should I bring for ladies suit stitching?','Bring your fabric, a reference photo if available and notes about your preferred fit. Message first to confirm how to arrange your order.'],['Can I request a custom shalwar kameez design?','Yes. Share a photo, sketch or description so the style, fabric requirements and finishing can be discussed.'],['How much does ladies suit stitching cost?','The published rate list is an indicative guide. Confirm the current price and final quote for your garment before work begins.'],['Can I provide my own fabric?','You can discuss your own fabric with Arisha. Share its details and the outfit reference before cutting so quantity and suitability can be reviewed.'],['Can I provide my own measurements?','Yes. You can share your measurements or arrange to visit the shop for measurements. Confirm the details before stitching begins.'],['How long does a suit take to stitch?','Turnaround depends on the garment, design details and current workload. Confirm the expected completion date when placing the order.'],['Is home delivery available in Lahore?','Home delivery is available in confirmed Lahore service areas. Ask about coverage, charges and timing before placing the order.'],['Can I get fabric picked up from my home?','No. Doorstep fabric pickup is not available. Contact Arisha to discuss how to arrange your fabric and order.']]},
 '/party-wear/':{eyebrow:'CELEBRATIONS & EVENTS',title:'Party wear stitching with thoughtful details',startingPrice:1500,intro:'Discuss formal suits, frocks, maxis, pishwas and event outfits, with attention to fabric, finishing and the silhouette you prefer.',image:IMAGES.party,faq:[['Can you stitch party wear from a reference image?','Yes. Share a clear reference on WhatsApp so the silhouette, fabric and finishing can be discussed.'],['What party wear outfits can I discuss?','You can enquire about formal suits, frocks, maxis, pishwas and other occasion outfits. Confirm the exact design before booking.'],['How much does party wear stitching cost?','Party wear stitching starts from the indicative price shown on the service page. Embellishment, lining and finishing can change the final quote.'],['Does embroidery or handwork affect the stitching price?','Yes. Fabric, lining, handwork and finishing affect the work involved. Confirm what is included in the quote before booking.'],['Can I choose my own neckline and sleeve design?','Yes. Share your preferred neckline, sleeves and reference details so they can be discussed before cutting.'],['When should I book party wear stitching?','Contact Arisha early and share your event date. Availability and a realistic completion date must be confirmed directly.'],['Can I arrange measurements at the shop?','Yes. You can visit the shop to discuss your outfit and have measurements taken, or provide your own measurements.'],['Can my finished party outfit be delivered?','Home delivery is available in confirmed Lahore service areas. Confirm delivery charges and timing when placing the order.']]},
 '/bridal-wear/':{eyebrow:'YOUR SPECIAL DAY',title:'Bridal wear planning, one detail at a time',startingPrice:8000,intro:'Bring your bridal lehenga, gharara, sharara or gown idea. Discuss fabric, embroidery, fitting, lining and a realistic timeline before confirming.',image:IMAGES.bridal,faq:[['What should I bring to a bridal stitching consultation?','Bring design references, fabric details if available and your event date. These help Arisha understand the scope before quoting.'],['What bridal outfits can I enquire about?','You can discuss bridal lehenga, gharara, sharara and gown ideas. Confirm the exact design and work required during consultation.'],['How much does bridal wear stitching cost?','Bridal stitching starts from the indicative price shown on the service page. The final quote depends on design, fabric, embroidery and finishing.'],['Is the displayed bridal stitching price final?','No. Bridal work varies significantly by design and handwork. Request a custom quote after discussing the complete design.'],['How much fabric is needed for a bridal dress?','Quantity depends on measurements, fabric width, silhouette, flare, panels and border placement. Confirm it with the tailor using your exact design before buying or cutting.'],['How many bridal fittings are needed?','The fitting plan depends on the design and fit. Agree on the number and timing of fittings before work starts.'],['When should I book bridal stitching?','Share your event date as early as possible. Arisha will need to confirm availability and a realistic schedule for the design.'],['Can I share bridal design pictures on WhatsApp?','Yes. Send clear reference images and available fabric details to start a discussion about the design and quote.']]},
 '/casual-wear/':{eyebrow:'EVERYDAY COMFORT',title:'Casual wear that feels like you',startingPrice:1000,intro:'Simple shalwar kameez, daily suits and comfortable kurta styles made around your preferred fit and everyday routine.',image:IMAGES.casual,faq:[['Can I choose a loose or fitted casual suit?','Yes. Tell Arisha how you prefer the shirt and sleeves to fit so the intended style can be discussed.'],['Can you stitch a matching trouser or shalwar?','Discuss the complete outfit and fabric quantity before cutting so all pieces can be planned together.'],['How much does casual suit stitching cost?','Casual wear stitching starts from the indicative price shown on the service page. Confirm the current rate and final design quote.'],['Which fabric should I choose for a casual suit?','Fabric choice depends on season, comfort, drape and the design. Share the fabric and reference so suitability can be discussed.'],['Can I bring my own fabric?','You can discuss your own fabric with Arisha. Confirm the design and fabric quantity before cutting.'],['Can I provide my measurements?','Yes. You can provide your measurements or arrange a visit to the shop for measurements.'],['How long does casual suit stitching take?','Turnaround depends on the garment and current workload. Confirm the expected date before placing the order.'],['Is home delivery available for casual suits?','Home delivery is available in confirmed Lahore service areas. Confirm coverage, charges and timing when ordering.']]},
 '/western-wear/':{eyebrow:'MODERN SILHOUETTES',title:'Western wear, tailored to your idea',startingPrice:1200,intro:'Discuss custom dresses, co-ords, trousers, tops and western-inspired looks with your reference picture and fabric in hand.',image:IMAGES.western,faq:[['Can I share a Pinterest or photo reference for western wear?','Yes. Send a clear reference on WhatsApp so the style and construction can be discussed.'],['Which western wear styles can I enquire about?','You can discuss custom dresses, co-ords, trousers, tops and western-inspired looks. Confirm the exact garment before booking.'],['How much does western wear stitching cost?','Western wear stitching starts from the indicative price shown on the service page. Confirm the final quote for your design.'],['Can you help me choose fabric for a western outfit?','Share the reference and fabric details. Suitability depends on the design, fabric behaviour and intended fit.'],['Can I request a particular fit?','Yes. Explain your preferred fit and garment measurements before stitching begins.'],['Can I provide my own measurements?','Yes. You can provide your measurements or arrange to visit the shop for measurements.'],['Do you also alter western dresses?','Arisha lists alteration services. Share details and photos of the garment to discuss whether the requested change is possible.'],['Can I arrange home delivery in Lahore?','Home delivery is available in confirmed Lahore service areas. Confirm charges and timing when placing the order.']]},
 '/alteration/':{eyebrow:'FIT & FINISH',title:'Ladies dress alteration and fitting in Lahore',startingPrice:300,intro:'Ask about ladies dress alterations in Lahore, including sleeve, waist, length and fitting adjustments. Each garment is assessed before confirming what can be changed.',image:IMAGES.alterations,faq:[['What types of ladies dress alterations can I enquire about?','You can ask about sleeve, waist, length and fit adjustments. The garment must be assessed before confirming the work.'],['Can every dress be altered?','Not always. Seam allowance, fabric, lining and original construction affect what can safely be changed.'],['How much do ladies dress alterations cost?','Alterations start from the indicative price shown on the service page. The final price depends on the garment and work required.'],['Do I need to bring the garment for assessment?','Message Arisha first to discuss the issue and confirm the best way to arrange an assessment.'],['Can an embroidered dress be altered?','It depends on the embroidery placement, seams, lining and available fabric. The garment needs to be assessed before a decision.'],['Can you shorten sleeves or dress length?','Sleeve and length adjustments can be discussed, but the available seam allowance and garment construction determine what is possible.'],['How long do alterations take?','Timing depends on the garment and the adjustment required. Confirm the expected completion date before approving the work.'],['Can an altered garment be delivered to my home?','Home delivery is available in confirmed Lahore service areas. Confirm delivery charges and timing when arranging the order.']]}
};
